# Runs the portable suite on Node.
#
# ci/js-build.hxml and ci/node-build.hxml prove CrossByte compiles for the
# browser and for Node. Compiling is not running: a ByteArray that adopts an
# ArrayBuffer where its storage is a Uint8Array breaks every read and write
# on js while every js build stays green, and fails this suite at once.
#
# Only cases needing no threads, no listening socket and no database are here;
# the rest of the suite still runs on cpp, interp and jvm.
-cp src
-cp tests
-lib utest
-lib hxnodejs
-main JsTestMain
--js export/js-tests/tests.js
--macro crossbyte.test.SuiteCoverage.check()
